{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们不仅得到了校长的许可，还拿到了资金。", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且正如计划的那样，成功找到了做蛋糕的地方！」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": "「而且正如计划的那样，成功找到了做蛋糕的地方！」", "plain_idx": 144, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2572", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二天的休息时间，我和安洁两个人占领了烹饪教室。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": "第二天的休息时间，我和安洁两个人占领了烹饪教室。", "plain_idx": 146, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "终于，期末典礼的准备——开始了。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": "终于，期末典礼的准备——开始了。", "plain_idx": 147, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然谈判花了一整天，总之取得了许可就好」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": "「虽然谈判花了一整天，总之取得了许可就好」", "plain_idx": 148, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，对了对了。放学之后料理研究会的各位也会过来呢」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": "「啊，对了对了。放学之后料理研究会的各位也会过来呢」", "plain_idx": 149, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2573", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，总之今天我们先借用一个位置吧」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到昨天为止，第二学期的特别课程已经全部结束，从今天开始这里就不会有人来上课了。", "text_idx": 152, "plain": "到昨天为止，第二学期的特别课程已经全部结束，从今天开始这里就不会有人来上课了。", "plain_idx": 152, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因此，这里本该是料理研究会的人独占的，我还跑去和她们商量了一下借用的事。", "text_idx": 153, "plain": "因此，这里本该是料理研究会的人独占的，我还跑去和她们商量了一下借用的事。", "plain_idx": 153, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「期末典礼的前一天我们无论如何都要借用这个地方，所以最开始的时候还是谨慎一点吧」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": "「期末典礼的前一天我们无论如何都要借用这个地方，所以最开始的时候还是谨慎一点吧」", "plain_idx": 154, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真不愧是少爷，真是擅长说服女人啊……」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": "「真不愧是少爷，真是擅长说服女人啊……」", "plain_idx": 155, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2574", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说，你这是什么说法啊……」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一听到少爷的甜言蜜语，安洁立刻就会被迷倒哦？」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "「一听到少爷的甜言蜜语，安洁立刻就会被迷倒哦？」", "plain_idx": 158, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2575", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是因为是安洁才会这样啊」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，那就麻烦少爷把甜言蜜语都留给安洁一个人吧」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2576", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁笑着说。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的语气很轻快，让我又好气又好笑。", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样看来，安洁说不定比我更擅长说服人呢。", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说是甜言蜜语，也不过是说安洁今天也很可爱、好喜欢你这种程度呢」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": "「说是甜言蜜语，也不过是说安洁今天也很可爱、好喜欢你这种程度呢」", "plain_idx": 166, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「每天都说这样的话，安洁会受不了的啊」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": "「每天都说这样的话，安洁会受不了的啊」", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2577", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，今天也……那个、那个、少爷……」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2578", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……安洁，过来」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我发现安洁的眼睛湿润了起来，便招手叫她过来。", "text_idx": 172, "plain": "我发现安洁的眼睛湿润了起来，便招手叫她过来。", "plain_idx": 172, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……啾、嗯……」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2579", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱住她，吻住了她渴望亲吻的嘴唇。", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……少爷」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2580", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在是我们两个人独处嘛……」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯嗯～……少爷，安洁的少爷，最最最喜欢少爷了～……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "「嗯嗯嗯～……少爷，安洁的少爷，最最最喜欢少爷了～……」", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2581", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁一副已经忍不住的样子，紧紧地抱住我磨蹭着。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "安洁一副已经忍不住的样子，紧紧地抱住我磨蹭着。", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着她这么高兴的样子，我自然是每天都想对她甜言蜜语了。", "text_idx": 182, "plain": "看着她这么高兴的样子，我自然是每天都想对她甜言蜜语了。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……立刻就变得如此黏人的安洁，真是可爱，最喜欢你了」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "「……立刻就变得如此黏人的安洁，真是可爱，最喜欢你了」", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，现在也是。", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊啊……！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2582", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她颤抖着，流露出感慨的声音，然后抬起脸，对着我微笑。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": "她颤抖着，流露出感慨的声音，然后抬起脸，对着我微笑。", "plain_idx": 187, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2583", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以把您的头靠过来吗？」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2584", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我向着安洁的方向稍稍倾斜了身体。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯♪」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2585", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁抱着我的头，埋进了她的胸口。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少爷，少爷……是奶子哦～……」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2586", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈……好痛苦，安洁」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然除了痛苦，还有点舒适。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脸被安洁的柔软包裹着，一呼一吸都是安洁的体香……", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "我的脸被安洁的柔软包裹着，一呼一吸都是安洁的体香……", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是少爷喜欢的东西……」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2587", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请尽情享用……只限于安洁，尽情享用吧……」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "「请尽情享用……只限于安洁，尽情享用吧……」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2588", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那……我要开始蹭了」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的……」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2589", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在极度喜悦的时候也想让我也开心起来，这样让我感觉更高兴了。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": "她在极度喜悦的时候也想让我也开心起来，这样让我感觉更高兴了。", "plain_idx": 211, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，我能“放松下来”才是安洁最开心的事，那我也就不再客气，按着自己喜欢的来了。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": "而且，我能“放松下来”才是安洁最开心的事，那我也就不再客气，按着自己喜欢的来了。", "plain_idx": 212, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次都是这样，这是我们之间独有的良性循环。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
