{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯、嗯唔、嗯……」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2590", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在学校里很难有两人独处的机会，我们也是忍了很久了。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "在学校里很难有两人独处的机会，我们也是忍了很久了。", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "终于分开了身体，我们两人羞涩地相视一笑。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "终于分开了身体，我们两人羞涩地相视一笑。", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎嘿……差不多，该开始了吧」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2591", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，那首先做什么呢？」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「首先是写配方，试做然后改进。就麻烦少爷来试吃啦♪」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "「首先是写配方，试做然后改进。就麻烦少爷来试吃啦♪」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「——所以，我们先试做了几个蛋糕」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "「——所以，我们先试做了几个蛋糕」", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2593", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，安洁立刻照着中午写的几个配方制作了出来。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "放学后，安洁立刻照着中午写的几个配方制作了出来。", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的眼前并排摆着5种蛋糕，看起来软绵绵的。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "我的眼前并排摆着5种蛋糕，看起来软绵绵的。", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为经费很充足，才能做这么多，真是令人感激呢。啊哈哈」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "「因为经费很充足，才能做这么多，真是令人感激呢。啊哈哈」", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2594", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实……如果没有校长赞助的话，真不知道会成什么样子啊」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": "「确实……如果没有校长赞助的话，真不知道会成什么样子啊」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天去找她的时候，只是想着让她先知道这件事，\\n其他的以后再考虑的", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "昨天去找她的时候，只是想着让她先知道这件事，其他的以后再考虑的", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我还是思虑不周啊。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为了不辜负校长的助力，一定要好好地给期末典礼准备一个美味的蛋糕啊，安洁」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「为了不辜负校长的助力，一定要好好地给期末典礼准备一个美味的蛋糕啊，安洁」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的，这也是报恩的一部分呢」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2595", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总而言之……请少爷先试吃一下。我来帮您切一块」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": "「总而言之……请少爷先试吃一下。我来帮您切一块」", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2596", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁指着蛋糕，微笑着回应我。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "安洁指着蛋糕，微笑着回应我。", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先试吃哪一个呢？」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2597", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，看起来都很好吃……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，安洁连做蛋糕也很擅长呢」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「话说，安洁连做蛋糕也很擅长呢」", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我眼前排列的蛋糕，每一个都像专业人士做的一样漂亮。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "我眼前排列的蛋糕，每一个都像专业人士做的一样漂亮。", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然说安洁本来就擅长料理，做这个肯定也没问题，但是能做到这个程度，还是让人忍不住想说一句。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "虽然说安洁本来就擅长料理，做这个肯定也没问题，但是能做到这个程度，还是让人忍不住想说一句。", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁再全能也是有限度的，这都是多亏了母亲的教导」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「安洁再全能也是有限度的，这都是多亏了母亲的教导」", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2598", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她告诉我，我会做的事越多，就越开心。现在我完全理解了，呼呼呼」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "「她告诉我，我会做的事越多，就越开心。现在我完全理解了，呼呼呼」", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag2599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，这样啊」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "结女校学生A", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生同学，什么“啊哈哈，这样啊”啊！」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ja0062", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_04.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在此时，我突然被吐槽了。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
